msgstr ""
"`Všetky zmeny podrobne <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/82?"
"closed=1>`__."

msgid "Weblate 4.12"
msgstr "Weblate 4.12"

msgid "*Released on April 20th 2022.*"
msgstr "*Vydané 20. apríla 2022.*"

msgid "Added support for Amharic in :ref:`check-end-stop`."
msgstr "Pridaná podpora pre amharčinu v :ref:`check-end-stop`."

msgid "Added support for Burmese in :ref:`check-end-question`."
msgstr "Pridaná podpora pre barmčinu v :ref:`check-end-question`."

msgid ""
"Extended options of the :ref:`addon-weblate.generate.pseudolocale` add-on."
msgstr "Rozšírené možnosti doplnku :ref:`addon-weblate.generate.pseudolocale`."

msgid ""
"Added ``ignore-all-checks`` flag to ignore all quality checks on a string."
msgstr ""
"Pridaný príznak ``ignore-all-checks`` na ignorovanie všetkých kontrol "
"kvality na reťazci."

msgid ""
"Avoid :ref:`addon-weblate.generate.pseudolocale` add-on to trigger failing "
"checks."
msgstr ""
"Zabránenie spúšťaniu nevyhovujúcich kontrol doplnkom :ref:`addon-"
