msgid "Fixed add-on installation using the API."
msgstr "Opravená inštalácia doplnku pomocou API."

msgid ""
"Renamed :guilabel:`Strings needing action` to :guilabel:`Unfinished strings`."
msgstr ""
"Premenované :guilabel:`Strings needing action` na :guilabel:`Unfinished "
