msgstr ""
"Prepísanie konfiguračného súboru Git vzdialeným vykonávaním kódu "
"(:cve:`2025-68398` / :ghsa:`8vcg-cfxj-p5m3`)."

msgid ""
"Arbitrary file read via symbolic links (:cve:`2025-68279` / :ghsa:`g925-"
"f788-4jh7`)."
msgstr ""
"Ľubovoľné čítanie súborov prostredníctvom symbolických odkazov "
"(:cve:`2025-68279` / :ghsa:`g925-f788-4jh7`)."

msgid "Locking error that prevented updating linked components."
msgstr "Chyba uzamknutia, ktorá bránila aktualizácii prepojených komponentov."

msgid "Fixed e-mail SSL configuration in Docker container."
msgstr "Opravená konfigurácia SSL e-mailu v Docker kontajneri."

msgid "Invitations on sites with required authentication."
msgstr "Pozvánky na stránkach s vyžadovanou autentifikáciou."

msgid ""
"`All changes in detail <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/159?"
"closed=1>`__."
msgstr ""
"`Všetky zmeny podrobne <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/159?"
"closed=1>`__."

msgid "Weblate 5.15"
msgstr "Weblate 5.15"

msgid "*Released on December 15th 2025.*"
msgstr "*Vydané 15. decembra 2025.*"

msgid ""
"Batch automatic translation can now be manually triggered at project "
"language, category or component level, see :ref:`auto-translation`."
msgstr ""
"Hromadný automatický preklad teraz možno manuálne spustiť na úrovni jazyka "
"projektu, kategórie alebo komponentu, pozrite :ref:`auto-translation`."

msgid ""
"Added ability to completely disable the admin contact form by "
"setting :setting:`CONTACT_FORM` to ``\"disabled\"``."
msgstr ""
"Pridaná možnosť úplne zakázať kontaktný formulár administrátora "
"nastavením :setting:`CONTACT_FORM` na ``\"disabled\"``."

msgid ""
"Added new Ollama machinery tool for local Ollama AI model integration, "
"see :ref:`mt-ollama`."
msgstr ""
"Pridaný nový nástroj strojového prekladu Ollama pre lokálnu integráciu AI "
"modelu Ollama, pozrite :ref:`mt-ollama`."

msgid ""
"Added :http:get:`/api/units/(int:id)/comments/` to get a list of comments "
"for the given translation unit."
msgstr ""
"Pridané :http:get:`/api/units/(int:id)/comments/` na získanie zoznamu "
"komentárov pre danú prekladovú jednotku."

msgid "Memory contents imported from TMX files include string context."
msgstr "Obsah pamäte importovaný zo súborov TMX zahŕňa kontext reťazca."

msgid ""
":doc:`/formats/xliff2`, :doc:`/formats/nextcloud-json`, :doc:`/formats/"
"resjson`, and :doc:`/formats/toml` are now supported file formats."
msgstr ""
":doc:`/formats/xliff2`, :doc:`/formats/nextcloud-json`, :doc:`/formats/"
"resjson` a :doc:`/formats/toml` sú teraz podporované formáty súborov."

msgid ""
":ref:`addon-weblate.fedora_messaging.publish` integration is now available "
"as add-on."
msgstr ""
"Integrácia :ref:`addon-weblate.fedora_messaging.publish` je teraz dostupná "
"ako doplnok."

msgid "Added :ref:`check-laravel-format` quality check."
msgstr "Pridaná kontrola kvality :ref:`check-laravel-format`."

msgid "Added disk usage overview in :ref:`manage-performance`."
msgstr "Pridaný prehľad využitia disku v :ref:`manage-performance`."

msgid ":http:get:`/api/groups/` now includes ``admins``."
msgstr ":http:get:`/api/groups/` teraz zahŕňa ``admins``."

msgid ":ref:`mt-modernmt` better supports language variants."
msgstr ":ref:`mt-modernmt` lepšie podporuje jazykové varianty."

msgid ""
"Automatically translated strings are now identified by a dedicated flag "
"instead of a label."
msgstr ""
"Automaticky preložené reťazce sú teraz identifikované špeciálnym príznakom "
"namiesto štítku."

msgid ""
":ref:`addon-weblate.discovery.discovery` preserves :ref:`file_format_params`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`addon-weblate.discovery.discovery` zachováva :ref:`file_format_params`."

msgid ":ref:`mt-cyrtranslit` now supports Belarusian and Greek."
msgstr ":ref:`mt-cyrtranslit` teraz podporuje bielorusčinu a gréčtinu."

msgid ""
":ref:`block-user` now accepts internal notes that are not visible to the "
"user."
msgstr ""
":ref:`block-user` teraz akceptuje interné poznámky, ktoré nie sú viditeľné "
"pre používateľa."

msgid ""
":ref:`addon-weblate.webhook.slack` and :ref:`addon-weblate.webhook.webhook` "
"can be installed multiple times."
msgstr ""
":ref:`addon-weblate.webhook.slack` a :ref:`addon-weblate.webhook.webhook` je "
"možné nainštalovať viackrát."

msgid "Compatibility with Git SHA256 repositories."
msgstr "Kompatibilita s repozitármi Git SHA256."

msgid ""
"The allowed version control URLs can now be configured "
"using :setting:`VCS_ALLOW_SCHEMES` and :setting:`VCS_ALLOW_HOSTS`."
msgstr ""
"Povolené URL verziovacieho systému teraz možno konfigurovať "
"pomocou :setting:`VCS_ALLOW_SCHEMES` a :setting:`VCS_ALLOW_HOSTS`."

msgid ""
"The API timeout for creating pull requests or forking can now be configured "
"via :setting:`VCS_API_TIMEOUT`."
msgstr ""
"Časový limit API pre vytváranie pull requestov alebo forkingu teraz možno "
"konfigurovať prostredníctvom :setting:`VCS_API_TIMEOUT`."

msgid ""
"Improved VCS integration documentation to clarify Docker environment "
"variables, commit authorship, hosted vs. self-hosted setup, and "
"authentication options."
msgstr ""
"Vylepšená dokumentácia integrácie VCS na objasnenie premenných prostredia "
"Docker, autorstva zápisov, hosťovaného vs. self-hosted nastavenia a možností "
"autentifikácie."

msgid "Timestamps from past are now shown with more detail."
msgstr "Časové pečiatky z minulosti sa teraz zobrazujú podrobnejšie."

msgid ""
"Added two new :ref:`states` to provide more detailed tracking of work-in-"
"progress translations."
msgstr ""
"Pridané dva nové :ref:`states` na poskytnutie podrobnejšieho sledovania "
"prekladov v procese."

msgid ""
"Improper invitation validation upon accepting "
"(:cve:`2025-64725` / :ghsa:`m6hq-f4w9-qrjj`)."
msgstr ""
"Nesprávna validácia pozvánky pri prijatí (:cve:`2025-64725` / :ghsa:`m6hq-"
"f4w9-qrjj`)."

msgid ""
"Server-Side Request Forgery while cloning repository "
"(:cve:`2025-66407` / :ghsa:`hfpv-mc5v-p9mm`)."
msgstr ""
"Pašovanie požiadaviek na strane servera pri klonovaní repozitára "
"(:cve:`2025-66407` / :ghsa:`hfpv-mc5v-p9mm`)."

msgid ""
"Over‑permissive webhook endpoint enabling mass repository updates plus "
"component enumeration (:cve:`2025-67492` / :ghsa:`pj86-258h-qrvf`)."
msgstr ""
"Príliš permisivný koncový bod webhooku umožňujúci hromadné aktualizácie "
"repozitára plus enumeráciu komponentov (:cve:`2025-67492` / :ghsa:`pj86-258h-"
"qrvf`)."

msgid ""
"Notification settings disclosure via Weblate API "
"(:cve:`2025-67715` / :ghsa:`3pmh-24wp-xpf4`)."
msgstr ""
"Odhalenie nastavení upozornení prostredníctvom API Weblate "
"(:cve:`2025-67715` / :ghsa:`3pmh-24wp-xpf4`)."

msgid ""
":ref:`mt-deepl` integration now correctly handles translating to Chinese "
"variants."
msgstr ""
"Integrácia :ref:`mt-deepl` teraz správne spracováva preklad do čínskych "
"variantov."

msgid ""
":doc:`/formats/csv` format saving translations with empty source fields when "
"using monolingual base files."
msgstr ""
"Formát :doc:`/formats/csv` ukladá preklady s prázdnymi zdrojovými poliami "
"pri použití jednojazyčných základných súborov."

msgid ""
"Tighter validation of user and full names to avoid confusing homoglyphs."
msgstr ""
"Prísnejšia validácia používateľských mien a celých mien, aby sa zabránilo "
"mätúcim homoglyfom."

msgid "Avoid false positive checks upon committing pending changes."
msgstr ""
"Vyhnúť sa falošne pozitívnym kontrolám pri zapisovaní čakajúcich zmien."

msgid "Performance improvements for file upload."
msgstr "Vylepšenia výkonu pre nahrávanie súborov."

msgid "Show glossary matches for the source language."
msgstr "Zobraziť zhody v glosári pre zdrojový jazyk."

msgid "Pull/merge requests are now only created when necessary."
msgstr "Pull/merge requesty sa teraz vytvárajú iba v prípade potreby."

msgid ""
"Replaced custom ``RequireLoginMiddleware`` with Django 5.1's "
"``LoginRequiredMiddleware``. This makes settings ``LOGIN_REQUIRED_URLS`` and "
"``LOGIN_REQUIRED_URLS_EXCEPTIONS`` no longer supported, including their "
"Docker environment variable counterparts."
msgstr ""
"Nahradený vlastný ``RequireLoginMiddleware`` za ``LoginRequiredMiddleware`` "
"z Django 5.1. To znamená, že nastavenia ``LOGIN_REQUIRED_URLS`` a "
"``LOGIN_REQUIRED_URLS_EXCEPTIONS`` už nie sú podporované, vrátane ich "
"ekvivalentov v premenných prostredia Docker."

msgid ""
":ref:`addon-weblate.webhook.webhook` secret length is now validated to match "
"the Standard Webhooks specification."
msgstr ""
"Dĺžka tajomstva :ref:`addon-weblate.webhook.webhook` sa teraz validuje tak, "
"aby zodpovedala špecifikácii Standard Webhooks."

msgid "Python 3.12 or newer is now required."
msgstr "Teraz sa vyžaduje Python 3.12 alebo novší."

msgid "GLib 2.80 or newer is now required."
msgstr "Teraz sa vyžaduje GLib 2.80 alebo novší."

msgid "Dropped support for Web Monetization."
msgstr "Ukončená podpora pre Web Monetization."

msgid ""
":doc:`/formats/laravel` no longer includes ``return`` prefix in the keys."
msgstr ":doc:`/formats/laravel` už nezahŕňa prefix ``return`` v kľúčoch."

msgid ""
"There are several changes in :file:`settings_example.py`, most notable are "
"changed settings ``CRISPY_ALLOWED_TEMPLATE_PACKS`` and ``INSTALLED_APPS``; "
"please adjust your settings accordingly."
msgstr ""
"V súbore :file:`settings_example.py` je niekoľko zmien, najvýznamnejšie sú "
"zmenené nastavenia ``CRISPY_ALLOWED_TEMPLATE_PACKS`` a ``INSTALLED_APPS``; "
"prosím, upravte svoje nastavenia zodpovedajúcim spôsobom."

msgid ""
"`All changes in detail <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/152?"
"closed=1>`__."
msgstr ""
"`Všetky zmeny podrobne <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/152?"
"closed=1>`__."

msgid "Weblate 5.14.3"
msgstr "Weblate 5.14.3"

msgid "*Released on November 7th 2025.*"
msgstr "*Vydané 7. novembra 2025.*"

msgid "Observed HTTPS status in :ref:`manage-performance`."
msgstr "Sledovaný stav HTTPS v :ref:`manage-performance`."

msgid "Forced synchronization in the :guilabel:`Repository maintenance`."
msgstr "Vynútená synchronizácia v :guilabel:`Údržba repozitára`."

msgid ""
"`All changes in detail <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/157?"
"closed=1>`__."
msgstr ""
"`Všetky zmeny podrobne <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/157?"
"closed=1>`__."

msgid "Weblate 5.14.2"
msgstr "Weblate 5.14.2"

msgid "*Released on November 6th 2025.*"
msgstr "*Vydané 6. novembra 2025.*"

msgid "Performance when adding strings."
msgstr "Výkon pri pridávaní reťazcov."

msgid "Adding terms to glossary was not working in some situations."
msgstr "Pridávanie termínov do glosára nefungovalo v niektorých situáciách."

msgid ""
"`All changes in detail <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/155?"
"closed=1>`__."
msgstr ""
"`Všetky zmeny podrobne <https://github.com/WeblateOrg/weblate/milestone/155?"
"closed=1>`__."

msgid "Weblate 5.14.1"
msgstr "Weblate 5.14.1"

msgid "*Released on November 5th 2025.*"
