msgstr "Zdroje Mobile Kotlin"

msgid ""
"A variant of :doc:`/formats/android`. It differs in plural tag (``plural`` "
"is used instead of ``plurals``) and escaping."
msgstr ""
"Variant :doc:`/formats/android`. Líši sa v značke pre množné číslo (používa "
"sa ``plural`` namiesto ``plurals``) a v escapovaní."

msgid ""
"`Mobile Kotlin resources <https://github.com/icerockdev/moko-resources>`_"
msgstr "`Zdroje Mobile Kotlin <https://github.com/icerockdev/moko-resources>`_"

msgid "`Mobile Kotlin Resource`"
msgstr "`Zdroj Mobile Kotlin`"

msgid "Nextcloud Apps JSON files"
msgstr "Súbory JSON aplikácií Nextcloud"

msgid "JSON-based format used in Nextcloud Apps that use JavaScript and HTML."
msgstr ""
"Formát založený na JSONe používaný v aplikáciách Nextcloud, ktoré využívajú "
"JavaScript a HTML."

msgid "`Nextcloud JSON file`"
msgstr "`Súbor Nextcloud JSON`"

msgid "OpenDocument Format"
msgstr "Formát OpenDocument"

msgid ""
"The translatable content is extracted from the OpenDocument files and "
