"oblasti."

msgid ""
"`XML Localization Interchange File Format (XLIFF)` is usually used as "
"bilingual, but Weblate supports it as monolingual as well."
msgstr ""
"`XML Localization Interchange File Format (XLIFF)` sa zvyčajne používa ako "
"dvojjazyčný, ale Weblate ho podporuje aj ako jednojazyčný."

msgid "Weblate supports XLIFF in several variants:"
msgstr "Weblate podporuje XLIFF v niekoľkých variantoch:"

msgid "`XLIFF 1.2 translation file`"
msgstr "`Prekladový súbor XLIFF 1.2`"

msgid ""
"Simple XLIFF file where content of the elements is stored as plain text (all "
"XML elements being escaped)."
msgstr ""
"Jednoduchý súbor XLIFF, kde sa obsah prvkov ukladá ako obyčajný text (všetky "
"prvky XML sú escapované)."

msgid "`XLIFF 1.2 with placeables support`"
msgstr "`XLIFF 1.2 s podporou placeables`"

msgid "Standard XLIFF supporting placeables and other XML elements."
msgstr "Štandardný XLIFF podporujúci placeables a iné prvky XML."

msgid "`XLIFF 1.2 with gettext extensions`"
msgstr "`XLIFF 1.2 s rozšíreniami gettext`"

msgid ""
"XLIFF enriched by `XLIFF 1.2 Representation Guide for Gettext PO`_ to "
"support plurals."
msgstr ""
"XLIFF obohatený o `Sprievodcu reprezentáciou XLIFF 1.2 pre Gettext PO`_ na "
"podporu množných čísiel."

msgid "`XLIFF 1.2 with Apple extensions`"
msgstr "`XLIFF 1.2 s rozšíreniami Apple`"

msgid "XLIFF enriched by Apple to support plurals."
msgstr "XLIFF obohatený spoločnosťou Apple na podporu množných čísiel."

msgid "`XML Localization Interchange File Format (XLIFF)`_ specification"
msgstr "Špecifikácia `XML Localization Interchange File Format (XLIFF)`_"

msgid "`XLIFF 1.2 Representation Guide for Gettext PO`_"
msgstr "`Sprievodca reprezentáciou XLIFF 1.2 pre Gettext PO`_"

msgid "`XLIFF on Wikipedia <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XLIFF>`_"
msgstr "`XLIFF na Wikipédii <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XLIFF>`_"

msgid "Translation states"
msgstr "Stavy prekladu"

msgid ""
"The ``state`` attribute in the file is partially processed and mapped to the "
"\"Needs edit\" state in Weblate (the following states are used to flag the "
"string as needing edit if there is a target present: ``new``, ``needs-"
"translation``, ``needs-adaptation``, ``needs-l10n``). Should the ``state`` "
"attribute be missing, a string is considered translated as soon as a "
"``<target>`` element exists."
msgstr ""
"Atribút ``state`` v súbore je čiastočne spracovaný a mapovaný na stav "
"„Potrebuje úpravu“ vo Weblate (nasledujúce stavy sa používajú na označenie "
"reťazca ako vyžadujúceho úpravu, ak je prítomný cieľ: ``new``, ``needs-"
"translation``, ``needs-adaptation``, ``needs-l10n``). Ak atribút ``state`` "
"chýba, reťazec sa považuje za preložený, len čo existuje prvok ``<target>``."

msgid ""
"If the translation string has ``approved=\"yes\"``, it will also be imported "
"into Weblate as \"Approved\", anything else will be imported as \"Waiting "
"for review\" (which matches the XLIFF specification)."
msgstr ""
"Ak má prekladový reťazec ``approved=\"yes\"``, importuje sa do Weblate ako "
"„Schválené“, všetko ostatné sa importuje ako „Čaká na kontrolu“ (čo "
"zodpovedá špecifikácii XLIFF)."

msgid "While saving, Weblate doesn't add those attributes unless necessary:"
msgstr ""
"Pri ukladaní Weblate nepridáva tieto atribúty, pokiaľ to nie je potrebné:"

msgid ""
"The ``state`` attribute is only added in case string is marked as needing "
"edit."
msgstr ""
"Atribút ``state`` sa pridá iba v prípade, že je reťazec označený ako "
"vyžadujúci úpravu."

msgid ""
"The ``approved`` attribute is only added in case string has been reviewed."
msgstr ""
"Atribút ``approved`` sa pridá iba v prípade, že bol reťazec skontrolovaný."

msgid ""
"In other cases the attributes are not added, but they are updated in case "
"they are present."
msgstr "Iné prípady atribúty nepridávajú, ale aktualizujú ich, ak sú prítomné."

msgid ""
"That means that when using the XLIFF format, it is strongly recommended to "
"turn on the Weblate review process, in order to see and change the approved "
"state of strings."
msgstr ""
"To znamená, že pri používaní formátu XLIFF sa dôrazne odporúča zapnúť proces "
"kontroly Weblate, aby bolo možné vidieť a meniť schválený stav reťazcov."

msgid ""
"Similarly upon importing such files (in the upload form), you should "
"choose :guilabel:`Import as translated` under :guilabel:`Processing of "
"strings needing edit`."
msgstr ""
"Podobne pri importe takýchto súborov (vo formulári na nahratie) by ste mali "
"vybrať :guilabel:`Importovať ako preložené` pod :guilabel:`Spracovanie "
"reťazcov vyžadujúcich úpravu`."

msgid "Whitespace and newlines in XLIFF"
msgstr "Medzery a nové riadky v XLIFF"

msgid ""
"Generally types or amounts of whitespace is not differentiated between in "
"XML formats. If you want to keep it, you have to add the "
"``xml:space=\"preserve\"`` flag to the string."
msgstr ""
"Vo formátoch XML sa vo všeobecnosti nerozlišujú typy ani množstvo medzier. "
"Ak ich chcete zachovať, musíte k reťazcu pridať príznak "
"``xml:space=\"preserve\"``."

msgid "Specifying translation flags"
msgstr "Špecifikácia prekladových príznakov"

msgid ""
"You can specify additional translation flags (see :ref:`custom-checks`) by "
"using the ``weblate-flags`` attribute. Weblate also understands ``maxwidth`` "
"and ``font`` attributes from the XLIFF specification:"
msgstr ""
"Môžete špecifikovať ďalšie prekladové príznaky (pozri :ref:`custom-checks`) "
"pomocou atribútu ``weblate-flags``. Weblate tiež rozumie atribútom "
"``maxwidth`` a ``font`` zo špecifikácie XLIFF:"

msgid ""
"The ``font`` attribute is parsed for font family, size and weight, the above "
"example shows all of that, though only font family is required. Any "
"whitespace in the font family is converted to underscore, so ``Source Sans "
"Pro`` becomes ``Source_Sans_Pro``, please keep that in mind when naming the "
"font group (see :ref:`fonts`)."
msgstr ""
"Atribút ``font`` sa analyzuje na rodinu písma, veľkosť a hrúbku, vyššie "
"uvedený príklad ukazuje všetko, hoci vyžaduje sa iba rodina písma. Akékoľvek "
"medzery v rodine písma sa prevedú na podčiarkovník, takže ``Source Sans "
"Pro`` sa stane ``Source_Sans_Pro``, majte to na pamäti pri pomenovávaní "
"skupiny písiem (pozri :ref:`fonts`)."

msgid ""
"`font attribute in XLIFF 1.2 <https://docs.oasis-open.org/xliff/v1.2/os/"
"xliff-core.html#font>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Atribút font v XLIFF 1.2 <https://docs.oasis-open.org/xliff/v1.2/os/xliff-"
"core.html#font>`_"

msgid ""
"`maxwidth attribute in XLIFF 1.2 <https://docs.oasis-open.org/xliff/v1.2/os/"
"xliff-core.html#maxwidth>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Atribút maxwidth v XLIFF 1.2 <https://docs.oasis-open.org/xliff/v1.2/os/"
"xliff-core.html#maxwidth>`_"

msgid "String keys"
msgstr "Kľúče reťazcov"

msgid ""
"Weblate identifies the units in the XLIFF file by ``resname`` attribute in "
"case it is present and falls back to ``id`` (together with ``file`` tag if "
"present)."
msgstr ""
"Weblate identifikuje jednotky v súbore XLIFF pomocou atribútu ``resname``, "
"ak je prítomný, a v opačnom prípade sa vráti k ``id`` (spolu so značkou "
"``file``, ak je prítomná)."

msgid ""
"The ``resname`` attribute is supposed to be human friendly identifier of the "
"unit making it more suitable for Weblate to display instead of ``id``. The "
"``resname`` has to be unique in the whole XLIFF file. This is required by "
"Weblate and is not covered by the XLIFF standard - it does not put any "
"uniqueness restrictions on this attribute."
msgstr ""
"Atribút ``resname`` má byť ľahko čitateľným identifikátorom jednotky, čo ho "
"robí vhodnejším na zobrazenie vo Weblate namiesto ``id``. ``resname`` musí "
"byť jedinečný v celom súbore XLIFF. Toto vyžaduje Weblate a nie je to "
"pokryté štandardom XLIFF – ten neukladá žiadne obmedzenia jedinečnosti na "
"tento atribút."

