"Violates a property Weblate claims, through an in-scope actor and input."
msgstr ""
"Porušuje vlastnosť, ktorú Weblate deklaruje, prostredníctvom aktéra a vstupu "
"v rozsahu."

msgid ""
"`Security properties Weblate provides`_, `Input assumptions`_, `Adversary "
