#~ msgid ""
#~ "**VCS integration manipulation:** Attacker manipulates Weblate's "
#~ "interaction with the VCS (e.g., injecting malicious commands via crafted "
#~ "repository URLs if not sanitized, leading to RCE)."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Manipulácia s integráciou VCS:** Útočník manipuluje s interakciou "
